{"title":"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The parabolas <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d378a20f6ff5fdb410d3cc766e8b29fd870e1fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=ax^2 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8b1c322d02a45124028f44b1dcd92020ca740d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4 - bx^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> intersect the coordinate axes in exactly four points, and these four points are the vertices of a kite of area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59d20d448d04681481e2e779ccae06af77a28316.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1.5\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2.5\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"377\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Clearly, the parabolas must intersect the x-axis at the same two points. Their distance multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/9/969fcf63b7f1f3b26d79c923c75bef3a76ffce13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 - (-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> (the distance between the y-intercepts), all divided by 2 is equal to 12, the area of the kite (half the product of the diagonals). That distance is thus 4, and so the x-intercepts are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/1/b21d1ab618a3acdb90fa926a37a4e4f7568e7b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 0), (-2, 0).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"18\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c2f27ea1bf92fbbf2ab0a3af4f1110db2f0e396.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 4a - 2 \\rightarrow a = 0.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"168\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c6568fafb6b25dfe1008e77ed92a97ad30a81271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 4 - 4b \\rightarrow b = 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"154\" height=\"13\" /> Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1935e0ef34849e607a1ddf1af5845784839adb1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The parabolas must intersect the x-axis at the same two points for the kite to form. We find the x values at which they intersect by equating them and solving for x as shown below. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/6/0f601d1ddaf071ba0f385be4de7822e79c0c5034.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = ax^2-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d66c84377060b3c6314c17ed691d90bbfe01aca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 4 - bx^2\\rightarrow ax^2-2 = 4-bx^2\\rightarrow (a+b)x^2 = 6 \\rightarrow x = +\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"531\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fbf8890eeb8d3cb35d11909c1b5d760bb568bc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"76\" height=\"43\" />. The x-values of the y-intercepts is 0, so we plug in zero in each of them and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The area of a kite is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef5c6c2088811f159541a5bb36e50a4aecb5afc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{d_1*d_2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/44612d9d6ec37da7f4edd0f205d65cdac5954dc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5ddb87a9b04d53528a050ec7075f38adeb281f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />. The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117778db99ba8932dc35128d085c2619f4f690a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8faf50e63df1785b307efda38115057e9b3ed178.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"71\" height=\"43\" />. Solving for the area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b0db661ff67916b6fdfaa9af1a9e9723384a13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow \\dfrac{1}{2}*(6)*(2*\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}) = 12 \\rightarrow (2*\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}) = 4 \\rightarrow (\\sqrt{\\dfrac{6}{a+b}}) = 2 \\rightarrow \\dfrac{6}{a+b} = 4 \\rightarrow  \\dfrac{6}{4} = (a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"762\" height=\"43\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/3/1935e0ef34849e607a1ddf1af5845784839adb1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A\">2015 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017235801\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 204/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1963/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4426/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.722      1 Template:AMC12_box\n100.00%    7.722      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13968:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017235801 and revision id 142770. Rendering was trig